              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä diɔ̱ɔ̱k kɛ ruɔ̱n la Thɔ-lo-mon muc tin waŋkɛ, kɛnɛ muc malä a tho̱p wi̱i̱ yi̱kä min cɛ ta̱th Kuoth Nhial, kä la wal tin kuɔ̱r kuɔ̱ɔ̱r a waaŋɛ kɛɛl kɛ kɛ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial. Inɔ cuɛ luak thuk kɛ ta̱th.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
